<section id="story" class="section">
  <div class="wrap story-grid">
    <div class="story-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE STORY</span>
      <h2>One cart, one guy, one road.</h2>
      <p class="body-p">
        Juandi started with a single cart on the roadside. No power point, no
        fancy machine — beans ground by hand, espresso pulled by hand, brewed
        for whoever pulled up a stool.
      </p>
      <p class="body-p">
        Travellers kept stopping, then kept coming back, and most left a
        sticker behind. He's fussy about one thing above all: the beans. He's
        convinced he pours the best in Lombok, and he'll happily tell you why.
      </p>
      <p class="body-p last">
        The cart became a shop next to the money exchange on Jl. Raya
        Senggigi. Next comes a kitchen — one step in a twelve-year plan he's
        had in his head the whole time.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="pull-quote">
        <p>&ldquo;Best espresso I've had in Lombok. Made without electricity — just gas and muscle.&rdquo;</p>
        <cite>Dominik Krchnavy · Google review</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class="collage">
